"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... Portrait of Elon Musk, a white, middle-age man with short, dark hair, wearing a black suit\\noffice: Senior Advisor to the President\\npresident: Donald Trump\\nalongside: Massad Boulos\\ntermstart: January 20, 2025\\npredecessor: Tom Perez\\nterm_end: May 31, 2025\\nbirth_name: Elon Reeve Musk\\nbirth_date ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elon_Musk\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... Elon Musk has yet to confirm or deny the claim.\\n\\nIn a recent interview with the Daily Mail, Errol Musk, father of Tesla CEO Elon Musk, expressed his skepticism regarding a woman's claim that she is the mother of Elon's child. The woman in question, right ... \",\"title\":\"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/elon-musks-father-on-woman-claiming-to-be-mother-of-tesla-ceos-child-i-would-find-it-strange-if-a-woman-/articleshow/118835846.cms\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... A collapsing birth rate is the biggest danger civilization faces by far,\\\" Musk tweeted in 2022.\\n\\nFrom his college relationships to his marriages, here's a look back at Elon Musk's dating history.\\n\\nJennifer Gwynne\\n\\nIn the mid-1990s, Musk met Jennifer Gwynne while they were both ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/elon-musk-complete-dating-history-7502497\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... Clair told The New York Times that Musk told her that he had also fathered a child with a Japanese pop star, though this claim has not been confirmed.\\n\\nHere's everything to know about Elon Musk's 14 children: Nevada, Vivian, Griffin, Kai, Saxon, Damian, X Æ ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/all-about-elon-musk-children-11678749\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... I felt his heartbeat.\\\"\\n\\nMusk's child Vivian, came out as transgender in 2022 and legally changed her name from Xavier Musk, including taking her mother's last name.\\n\\nIn court, Vivian said she \\\"no longer lives with or wishes to be related to my biological father in ... \",\"title\":\"https://nypost.com/2024/06/23/us-news/elon-musks-12-kids-and-counting-what-to-know-about-the-tesla-billionaires-big-brood/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"acf0065ade5605e2ba4778966fbf8c5101449a798c4e7723e2fe78cc64e64436\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"eddddfa7165f8589847262fe62a95e514b37a1c6fc73e31d725ca34bbc349228\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"lady claimed related Elon Musk mother age birth article\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_168d2d827c2945f7a133192c"},{"content":"The most relevant result is d16, which mentions Riette Nel claiming to be Elon Musk's half-sister. Let me read that article to find the age at which her mother gave birth to her.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d16\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_60da8aad8a604f0ead00a08f","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d16\",\"document_chars\":4374,\"end\":3000,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e1\",\"sha256\":\"bc0d510dbd6cde0530cf08684de455d82ec1943c0ba50cab130ae01990cc24b8\",\"snapshot\":\"d7b7a23b3eb780d78018e5fe30d91613c9769a1cff7564bb0a79c08614acb838\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: RECOMMENDED\\nauthor: Bernie Zilio\\ndate: 2025-01-01\\n---\\nElon Musk Attempts To Go Incognito In First Sighting Since Alleged Half-Sister Claimed Dad Errol Refuses To Take DNA Test\\n\\nSept. 17 2021, Published 2:29 p.m. ET\\n\\nElon Musk is going about his merry, billionaire way despite all the recent drama plaguing his family.\\n\\nSpotted in New York City with his baby mama, Grimes, the second richest person in the world actually looked like he might've been going the extra mile to not be seen or recognized after a woman claiming to be his half-sister came forward last week and insisted that her late mother was Errol Musk's mistress in the 1970s.\\n\\nIn addition to sporting a black baseball cap that darn near covered his eyes, the 50-year-old technology tycoon also had a black bandana shielding the majority of his face and all of his neck.\\n\\nHe paired his tight-fitting navy blue SpaceX T-shirt with black denim jeans.\\n\\nThe aerospace company's CEO was likely preoccupied with what we now know was a successful launch of SpaceX's historic all-civilian shuttle into space on Wednesday night, but it's possible he was also giving thought to everything his newly revealed alleged half-sibling had to say.\\n\\nThe South African woman, 46-year-old Riette Nel (formerly van Deventer), claims that her mom, Riana van Deventer, confessed to Riana's son/Riette's half-brother, Gerrit van Deventer, on her deathbed in October of 2019 that Elon's father, 75-year-old Errol Musk, was Riette's father, too.\\n\\nRiette said Gerrit told her earlier this year and that she eventually got in contact with Errol, who she claims showed initial interest in taking a DNA test but has since backed out and left her hanging.\\n\\n\\\"I don't want anything from Errol or Elon, I just want to know what my roots are,\\\" Riette said in the shocking interview. \\\"I have told Errol you are welcome to have your attorneys draw up a contract which says I am not entitled to any kind of remuneration. The only thing I am interested in is to know if you're my dad.\\\"\\n\\nAccording to her birth certificate, Riette was born Mariette van Deventer in Ladysmith in eastern South Africa on August 8, 1975. Her mother was 21 when she gave birth, and there is no father named in the paperwork.\\n\\nRiette said her mom told her that she had gotten pregnant with her during a tryst at the Union Buildings (South Africa's Parliament).\\n\\n\\\"All she told me was that the guy had a lot of money, he had a Rolls Royce and a yacht,\\\" she explained. \\\"I believe that man was Errol because everything just fits. He was the guy with the money. He was the arrogant guy, self-entitled, self-assured. And he didn't treat women the way he was supposed to.\\\"\\n\\nAs for Gerrit, he said his mother \\\"was sure that Elon Musk was Riette's brother. She didn't tell me it as an absolute fact, but she had that confidence in her voice that made me believe her immediately.\\\"\\n\\nRiette added, \\\"Why would my mother lie to my brother? She knew she was dying, she had nothing to lose and nothing t\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":3000,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_60da8aad8a604f0ead00a08f"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Only finish is available. Submit an explicit answer with delivered evidence or abstain.\",\"literal_answer_contract\":{\"origin\":\"explicit experiment configuration, not inferred from question\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\"},\"phase\":\"FINAL\",\"remaining\":{\"action_slots\":197,\"backend_calls\":113,\"model_calls\":1,\"output_reservation\":47666},\"research_workflow\":{\"active_gap_not_verifi